@startuml
title Module de hachage des mots de passe - POS2 Restaurant

actor "Utilisateur\n(Client / Serveur / Admin)" as User
boundary "Interface React" as React
control "AuthController" as Controller
control "AuthService" as Service
control "PasswordEncoder\nBCrypt" as Encoder
database "MySQL\nTable users" as DB

== Inscription ==
User -> React : Saisir téléphone, OTP,\nnom et mot de passe
React -> Controller : POST /api/auth/register
Controller -> Service : registerClient(request)
Service -> Service : Vérifier OTP
Service -> Encoder : encode(password)
Encoder --> Service : passwordHash
Service -> DB : Sauvegarder user\navec passwordHash
DB --> Service : User créé
Service --> Controller : AuthResponse
Controller --> React : Informations utilisateur

== Connexion ==
User -> React : Saisir téléphone\net mot de passe
React -> Controller : POST /api/auth/login
Controller -> Service : login(request)
Service -> DB : findByPhone(phone)
DB --> Service : User + passwordHash
Service -> Encoder : matches(password, passwordHash)
Encoder --> Service : true / false
Service --> Controller : AuthResponse ou erreur
Controller --> React : Connexion acceptée ou refusée

@enduml
